{
  "name": "Invoice Archiving & Processing",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Invoice Archiving & Processing\n\n**Automated Invoice Collection, PDF Processing & Cloud Archiving**\n\nAutomatically collect PDF invoices from Gmail, identify providers, extract key billing information, organize documents, and track invoices in Google Sheets.\n\nA configurable, rule-based workflow designed to reduce repetitive administrative work without requiring AI services.\n\n**Support & Customization:** [Request Consultation](mailto:info@paoloronco.it)\n\n---\n\n## How It Works\n\n1. **Trigger** — Run manually or automatically every 6 hours.\n2. **Gmail Intake** — Search for invoice emails and retrieve PDF attachments.\n3. **PDF Processing** — Extract text and identify the invoice provider.\n4. **Data Extraction** — Parse invoice number, date, total amount, and category.\n5. **Validation** — Reject unsupported documents or invoices with missing required fields.\n6. **Document Archiving** — Organize and upload invoices to category-specific SFTP folders.\n7. **Google Sheets Tracking** — Insert or update invoice records using a unique invoice identifier.\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Connect your **Gmail**, **SFTP**, and **Google Sheets** credentials.\n2. Configure the Gmail search query and invoice lookback period.\n3. Replace the example provider detection patterns with your own.\n4. Configure the SFTP destination folders.\n5. Create a Google Sheets worksheet named `Invoices` with the required columns.\n6. Replace `REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` with your spreadsheet ID.\n7. Test each invoice category before activating the schedule.\n\n## Customization\n\n- **Providers:** Add or modify invoice provider detection rules.\n- **Categories:** Customize invoice classification and destination folders.\n- **Extraction:** Adapt regex patterns to different invoice layouts.\n- **File Naming:** Modify the standardized PDF filename format.\n- **Tracking:** Extend Google Sheets with additional billing fields.\n- **Scheduling:** Adjust execution frequency and Gmail filters.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- n8n instance\n- Gmail account with OAuth2 access\n- SFTP server with writable directories\n- Google Sheets spreadsheet\n- Text-based PDF invoices\n\n**No AI API keys or paid AI services required.**\n\n\n",
        "height": 1016,
        "width": 636,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "cf62e776-c0a6-40f4-9db8-3565cf02e0ab",
